($$123 Mini Chefs at Best Start Family Hub Queens Road$$, $$215 Queens Rd, London E17 8PJ$$, $$E17 8PJ$$, 51.576522, -0.027894799999999997, $$Developmental play$$, $$10:00$$, $$12:00$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=2976073963514090931&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/123-mini-chefs-best-start-family-hub-queens-road$$, null, null, 8, $$Parents, babies and young children$$, $$Waltham Forest$$, array[$$Friday$$], null, $$Runs weekly on Friday; term time only. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$Enjoy the fun of cooking with your toddler, while transferring learnt skills from our class to your home. Age: 2 years and above This session is run term time only. Please note children attending this session must be able to use cutlery independently. Cost: £2.50 first child, 50p siblings. More information: Parental supervision required. Parents pay by debit card on the day using the QR code within the hub. We do not accept cash This is a Best Start in Life weekly session. When you see Curious Carina you can expect play and learning sessions that will support your child’s learning and development.$$, $$£2.50 first child, 50p siblings$$, false, $$Waltham Forest Best Start in Life events$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/123-mini-chefs-best-start-family-hub-queens-road$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/sites/default/files/styles/3_2_lossless_responsive/public/2023-09/1-2-3%20mini%20chef.png.webp?itok=8V8urOdO$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/123-mini-chefs-best-start-family-hub-queens-road$$, $$ChIJ8QjxFb8ddkgRs9WLfIAjTSk$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=2976073963514090931&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, null, 3.5, 8, $$health$$, null, null, null, array[$$2026-09-18$$, $$2026-09-25$$, $$2026-10-02$$, $$2026-10-09$$, $$2026-10-16$$, $$2026-10-23$$, $$2026-10-30$$, $$2026-11-06$$, $$2026-11-13$$, $$2026-11-20$$]::date[], n