($$Baby and Toddler Clothes Exchange at Lea Bridge Library$$, $$Lea Bridge Rd, London E10 7HU$$, $$E10 7HU$$, 51.5707759, -0.0236276, $$Family activities$$, $$11:00$$, $$12:00$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=15028814885973325979&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/baby-and-toddler-clothes-exchange-lea-bridge-library$$, null, null, 115, $$Parents, babies and young children$$, $$Waltham Forest$$, array[$$Friday$$], null, $$Council dates listed through 2026-10-30. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$A baby and toddler clothes exchange day where you can meet other parents and exchange baby clothes for free. This is great opportunity to save money on clothes for your little one whilst getting to know other local families! 11am to 12pm on the last Friday of every month. This is a Best Start in Life session. When you see Active Ashton you can expect a session to promote your child’s health.$$, $$Free$$, false, $$Waltham Forest Best Start in Life events$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/baby-and-toddler-clothes-exchange-lea-bridge-library$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/sites/default/files/styles/3_2_lossless_responsive/public/2024-08/116.png.webp?h=968c7e23&itok=xC-x28i3$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/baby-and-toddler-clothes-exchange-lea-bridge-library$$, $$ChIJd7ScnL0ddkgRm_iKQYMTkdA$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=15028814885973325979&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, null, 4.1, 115, $$library$$, null, null, null, array[$$2026-09-25$$, $$2026-10-30$$]::date[], null, null, array[$$Friday$$], $$specific_dates$$, $$Council dates listed through 2026-10-30. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$published$$),
($$Baby feeding group at Walthamstow Library$$, $$High St, London E17 7JN$$, $$E17 7JN$$, 51.5843324, -0.021167000000000002, $$Feeding & postnatal support$$, $$11:00$$, $$12:30$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=12456512494757751249&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/baby-feeding-group-walthamstow-library$$, null, null, 261, $$Parents, babies and young children$$, $$Waltham Forest$$, array[$$Wednesday$$], null, $$Council dates listed through 2026-11-18. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$Whether you are breast, bottle or mixed feeding, our trained infant feeding practitioners can support you to give your baby a great start in life. We offer practical and emotional support for all parents with feeding your baby at any stage. An opportunity to meet up with other mothers in a small group to get support on your infant feeding journey from a HENRY Infant Feeding Practitioner. This is a Best Start in Life session, provided by HENRY. When you see Active Ashton you can expect a session to promote your child’s health.$$, $$Check council event page$$, false, $$Waltham Forest Best Start in Life events$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/baby-feeding-group-walthamstow-library$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/sites/default/files/styles/3_2_lossless_responsive/public/2023-10/HENRY%20baby%20pic.jpg.png.webp?itok=8Twhk2Sb$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/baby-feeding-group-walthamstow-library$$, $$ChIJiZq9FPUNdkgR0SlA1h1s3qw$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=12456512494757751249&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, null, 4.1, 261, $$library$$, null, null, null, array[$$2026-09-23$$, $$2026-09-30$$, $$2026-10-07$$, $$2026-10-14$$, $$2026-10-21$$, $$2026-10-28$$, $$2026-11-04$$, $$2026-11-11$$, $$2026-11-18$$]::date[], null, null, array[$$Wednesday$$], $$specific_dates$$, $$Council dates listed through 2026-11-18. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$published$$),
($$Baby Massage at Best Start Family Hub Chingford$$, $$5 Oaks Grove, London E4 6EY$$, $$E4 6EY$$, 51.625715199999995, 0.0096747, $$Baby massage$$, $$13:00$$, $$14:00$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=9118098950548432754&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/baby-massage-best-start-family-hub-chingford$$, null, null, 16, $$Parents, babies and young children$$, $$Waltham Forest$$, array[$$Wednesday$$], null, $$Runs weekly on Wednesday. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$You will learn how to massage your baby safely during this weekly five-session course. Massage offers benefits such as bonding, calming your baby, improving sleep, aiding digestion, and enhancing circulation. We recommend you start after your baby has had their six checks and when your baby is content and alert. Course 1 will take place on 16, 23, 30 September, 7, 14 October 2026 Course 2 will take place on 4, 11, 18, 25 November, 2 December 2026 Course 3 will take place on 13, 20, 27 January, 3, 10 February 2027 Course 4 will take place on 24 February, 3, 10, 17, 24 March 2027 This is a Best Start in Life session. When you see Active Ashton you can expect a session to promote your child’s health.$$, $$Check council event page$$, false, $$Waltham Forest Best Start in Life events$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/baby-massage-best-start-family-hub-chingford$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/sites/default/files/styles/3_2_lossless_responsive/public/2024-04/Baby%20massage%20%28Ashton%29.png.webp?itok=BdDF_TK3$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/baby-massage-best-start-family-hub-chingford$$, $$ChIJq6reh5mg2EcRcidNjq_-iX4$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=9118098950548432754&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, null, 4.4, 16, $$health$$, null, null, null, array[$$2026-09-16$$, $$2026-09-23$$, $$2026-09-30$$, $$2026-10-07$$, $$2026-10-14$$, $$2026-10-21$$, $$202