($$Bambini s music and play 0 to1 at Queens Road$$, $$215 Queens Rd, London E17 8PJ$$, $$E17 8PJ$$, 51.576522, -0.027894799999999997, $$Music & singing$$, $$10:00$$, $$10:45$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=2976073963514090931&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/bambinis-music-and-play-0-to1-queens-road$$, null, null, 8, $$Under 2s$$, $$Waltham Forest$$, array[$$Thursday$$], null, $$Runs weekly on Thursday; term time only. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$Bambini’s Music and Play is a calming sensory session for babies aged under one year, featuring black-and-white visuals, mirror play, and tummy time to support early development. It encourages fine motor skills and engagement through singing, textures, and gentle interaction. This is a nurturing space for babies and carers to explore and bond. Age: Under 1s Cost: £2.50 first child, 50p siblings. Parental supervision required. Parents pay by debit card on the day using the QR code within the hub. Payment by card only. This is a Best Start in Life weekly session (term time only). When you see Curious Carina you can expect play and learning sessions that will support your child’s learning and development.$$, $$£2.50 first child, 50p siblings$$, false, $$Waltham Forest Best Start in Life events$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/bambinis-music-and-play-0-to1-queens-road$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/sites/default/files/styles/3_2_lossless_responsive/public/2023-09/Spare%20-%20anything%20musical%20%28Carina%29.png.webp?itok=dqQqG9tS$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/bambinis-music-and-play-0-to1-queens-road$$, $$ChIJ8QjxFb8ddkgRs9WLfIAjTSk$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=2976073963514090931&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, null, 3.5, 8, $$health$$, null, null, null, array[$$2026-09-17$$, $$2026-09-24$$, $$2026-10-01$$, $$2026-10-08$$, $$2026-10-15$$, $$2026-10