($$Infant Feeding Support Appointments at Wood Street Library$$, $$1, Troubridge Square, Wood St, London E17 3HB$$, $$E17 3HB$$, 51.5872756, -0.0038318999999999996, $$Feeding & postnatal support$$, $$09:30$$, $$11:00$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=16001062556676665438&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/infant-feeding-support-appointments-wood-street-library$$, null, null, 98, $$Parents, babies and young children$$, $$Waltham Forest$$, array[$$Friday$$], null, $$Council dates listed through 2026-11-20; term time only. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$Whether you are breast, bottle or mixed feeding, our trained infant feeding practitioners can support you to give your baby a great start in life. We offer practical and emotional support for all parents with feeding your baby at any stage. An opportunity to meet up with other mothers in a small group to get support on your infant feeding journey from a HENRY Infant Feeding Practitioner. To better support the families we serve, we have restructured some of our sessions. We strongly recommend contacting our helpline first on 02079619073, so we can direct you to the most suitable session for your needs. To book your slot, phone HENRY on 0207 961 9073. This is a Best Start in Life session, provided by HENRY (term time only). When you see Active Ashton you can expect a session to promote your child’s health.$$, $$Check council event page$$, true, $$Waltham Forest Best Start in Life events$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/infant-feeding-support-appointments-wood-street-library$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/sites/default/files/styles/3_2_lossless_responsive/public/2023-10/HENRY%20baby%20pic.jpg.png.webp?itok=8Twhk2Sb$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/infant-feeding-support-appointments-wood-street-library$$, $$ChIJ-9O8C_kddkgRXjCEN54xD94$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=16001062556676665438&g_mp=Cidnb