($$Kids Crafts at North Chingford Library Saturday$$, $$The Grn, London E4 7EN$$, $$E4 7EN$$, 51.6315088, 0.0028544, $$Arts & crafts$$, $$11:00$$, $$12:00$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=12294318940621743426&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/kids-crafts-north-chingford-library-saturday$$, null, null, 63, $$Parents, babies and young children$$, $$Waltham Forest$$, array[$$Saturday$$], null, $$Runs weekly on Saturday. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$Come along to North Chingford Library for some amazing Saturday creative family fun. We run a variety of crafty ideas, often linked to topical themes. Suitable for children aged two and over, but little ones are welcome to be creative with support from their adults. Children must be accompanied by an adult. Free admission. For more information, you can message us on our Libraries Facebook or Libraries Instagram or email the Libraries support team . This is a Best Start in Life weekly session. When you see Curious Carina you can expect play and learning sessions that will support your child’s learning and development.$$, $$Free$$, false, $$Waltham Forest Best Start in Life events$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/kids-crafts-north-chingford-library-saturday$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/sites/default/files/styles/3_2_lossless_responsive/public/2023-09/Kids%20crafts%20%28Carina%29.png.webp?itok=2rLoGM74$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/kids-crafts-north-chingford-library-saturday$$, $$ChIJJ1FLX7cFdkgRQqUdO_Axnqo$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=12294318940621743426&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, null, 4, 63, $$library$$, null, null, null, array[$$2026-09-19$$, $$2026-09-26$$, $$2026-10-03$$, $$2026-10-10$$, $$2026-10-17$$, $$2026-10-24$$, $$2026-10-31$$, $$2026-11-07$$, $$2026-11-14$$]::date[], null, null, array[$$Saturday$$], $$weekly$$, $$Runs weekly on Saturday. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$published$$),
($$Kids Crafts at North Chingford Library Sunday$$, $$The Grn, London E4 7EN$$, $$E4 7EN$$, 51.6315088, 0.0028544, $$Arts & crafts$$, $$13:00$$, $$14:00$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=12294318940621743426&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/kids-crafts-north-chingford-library-sunday$$, null, null, 63, $$Parents, babies and young children$$, $$Waltham Forest$$, array[$$Sunday$$], null, $$Runs weekly on Sunday. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$Come along to North Chingford Library for some amazing Sunday creative family fun. We run a variety of crafty ideas, often linked to topical themes. Suitable for children aged two and over, but little ones are welcome to be creative with support from their adults. Children must be accompanied by an adult. Free admission For more information, you can message us on our Libraries Facebook or Libraries Instagram or send us an email at: Libraries.support@walthamforest.gov.uk This is a Best Start in Life weekly session. When you see Curious Carina you can expect play and learning sessions that will support your child’s learning and development.$$, $$Free$$, false, $$Waltham Forest Best Start in Life events$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/kids-crafts-north-chingford-library-sunday$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/sites/default/files/styles/3_2_lossless_responsive/public/2023-09/Kids%20crafts%20%28Carina%29.png.webp?itok=2rLoGM74$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/kids-crafts-north-chingford-library-sunday$$, $$ChIJJ1FLX7cFdkgRQqUdO_Axnqo$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=12294318940621743426&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, null, 4, 63, $$library$$, null, null, null, array[$$2026-09-13$$, $$2026-09-20$$, $$2026-09-27$$, $$2026-10-04$$, $$2026-10-11$$, $$2026-10-18$$, $$2026-10-25$$, $$2026-11-01$$, $$2026-11-08$$, $$2026-11-15$$]::date[], null, null, array[$$Sunday$$], $$weekl