($$Kids Crafts at North Chingford Library Tuesday and Thursday$$, $$The Grn, London E4 7EN$$, $$E4 7EN$$, 51.6315088, 0.0028544, $$Arts & crafts$$, $$15:30$$, $$16:30$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=12294318940621743426&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/kids-crafts-north-chingford-library-tuesday-and-thursday$$, null, null, 63, $$Parents, babies and young children$$, $$Waltham Forest$$, array[$$Tuesday$$, $$Thursday$$], null, $$Council dates listed through 2026-11-19. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$Come along to our Tuesday and Thursday Kids Craft events at North Chingford Library. We provide exciting and varied creative projects, often focusing on important dates and current celebrations and topics. Free event Suitable for children aged two and over, but little ones are welcome to be creative with support from their adults. All children must be accompanied and supported by their adults For more information you can message us on our Libraries Facebook or Libraries Instagram or send us an email here: Libraries.support@walthamforest.gov.uk$$, $$Free$$, false, $$Waltham Forest Best Start in Life events$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/kids-crafts-north-chingford-library-tuesday-and-thursday$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/sites/default/files/styles/3_2_lossless_responsive/public/2023-09/Library%20craft%20events%20%28Carina%29.png.webp?itok=YiYyG7kS$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/kids-crafts-north-chingford-library-tuesday-and-thursday$$, $$ChIJJ1FLX7cFdkgRQqUdO_Axnqo$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=12294318940621743426&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, null, 4, 63, $$library$$, null, null, null, array[$$2026-09-15$$, $$2026-09-17$$, $$2026-09-22$$, $$2026-09-24$$, $$2026-09-29$$, $$2026-10-01$$, $$2026-10-06$$, $$2026-10-08$$, $$2026-10-13$$, $$2026-10-15$$, $$2026-10-20$$, $$2026-10-22$$, $$2026-10-27