($$The parents lounge Break Tha Cycle Queens Road$$, $$215 Queens Rd, London E17 8PJ$$, $$E17 8PJ$$, 51.576522, -0.027894799999999997, $$Family activities$$, $$13:00$$, $$15:00$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=2976073963514090931&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/parents-lounge-break-tha-cycle-queens-road$$, null, null, 8, $$Parents, babies and young children$$, $$Waltham Forest$$, array[$$Tuesday$$], null, $$Council dates listed through 2026-11-17; term time only. Check the council event page for changes.$$, $$Connect with other parents, share experiences and talk about the topics that matter to you in a friendly, parent-led group. These relaxed sessions offer an opportunity to make new friends and build a supportive parent community. For more information, contact 07535 280 467. This is a Best Start in Life session (term-time only). When you see Brave Bilkis you can expect a session aimed to parents and children who may be having a difficult time. All sessions are run by skilled staff who are able to provide advice and information, and signpost to other family support services.$$, $$Check council event page$$, false, $$Waltham Forest Best Start in Life events$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/parents-lounge-break-tha-cycle-queens-road$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/sites/default/files/styles/3_2_lossless_responsive/public/2024-04/Break%20Tha%20Cycle%20%28Bilkis%29.png.webp?itok=-z72EE3S$$, $$https://www.walthamforest.gov.uk/events/parents-lounge-break-tha-cycle-queens-road$$, $$ChIJ8QjxFb8ddkgRs9WLfIAjTSk$$, $$https://maps.google.com/?cid=2976073963514090931&g_mp=Cidnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLlNlYXJjaFRleHQQAhgEIAA$$, null, 3.5, 8, $$health$$, null, null, null, array[$$2026-09-15$$, $$2026-09-22$$, $$2026-09-29$$, $$2026-10-06$$, $$2026-10-13$$, $$2026-10-20$$, $$2026-10-27$$, $$2026-11-03$$, $$2026-11-10$$, $$2026-11-17$$]::date[], null, null, array[$$Tues